WEBVTT

00:00:01.616 --> 00:00:03.533
[PHOENIX] We've learned that
the murder at Hazakura Temple

00:00:03.616 --> 00:00:05.616
was actually an attempt to
wipe out the bloodline

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.450
of the Kurain School of
channeling's main family.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:13.366
A hit job orchestrated by
none other than Morgan Fey.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.366
Also, the true identity of
the victim was revealed.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.866
It was Misty Fey, Maya's
long-lost mother.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:21.575
The final day
of the trial delivered

00:00:21.658 --> 00:00:23.700
the biggest twist so far.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:26.200
Sensing something
odd about Iris's behavior,

00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:28.408
I realized who she really was.

00:00:28.491 --> 00:00:30.491
The person on the
witness stand was not Iris,

00:00:30.575 --> 00:00:33.491
but the spirit of her twin
sister, Dahlia Hawthorne,

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:36.408
who had recently been
executed for her crimes.

00:00:36.491 --> 00:00:38.658
[DAHLIA]
My name is Dahlia Hawthorne,

00:00:38.741 --> 00:00:41.575
and I'm permanently retired.

00:00:41.658 --> 00:00:43.533
[PHOENIX] Now I need to know
where the real Iris is,

00:00:43.616 --> 00:00:46.075
and if Maya is still alive.

00:02:17.283 --> 00:02:19.116
[CROWD murmuring]

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:20.950
[GODOT]
Dahlia Hawthorne, huh?

00:02:21.033 --> 00:02:24.408
So. It seems you're done
trying to hide your identity.

00:02:24.491 --> 00:02:28.283
Yeah, well. I'm dead.
So what does it matter?

00:02:28.366 --> 00:02:30.866
I was executed, so it's
not like I can be punished

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:32.033
any harder, right?

00:02:32.116 --> 00:02:34.325
[JUDGE]
How is this possible?

00:02:34.408 --> 00:02:36.491
These instructions
detail Morgan Fey's plan

00:02:36.575 --> 00:02:37.783
for that night.

00:02:37.866 --> 00:02:40.741
Tell me--Did you have
prior knowledge of this?

00:02:40.825 --> 00:02:44.575
I did. Although I was
on death row at the time.

00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:46.575
I was still allowed to
visit with my mother

00:02:46.658 --> 00:02:48.033
every now and then.

00:02:48.116 --> 00:02:50.491
She told me of her plot
during one of those visits.

00:02:50.575 --> 00:02:53.408
[JUDGE] And what was
she planning, exactly?

00:02:53.491 --> 00:02:55.741
[DAHLIA]
She wanted to murder Maya Fey.

00:02:55.825 --> 00:02:58.366
[PHOENIX]
So the real target was Maya?

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:00.575
[DAHLIA] The idea was
that I would kill her.

00:03:00.658 --> 00:03:02.783
Then Iris would be
the one to hang for it.

00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:04.950
Things didn't go
exactly as we wanted,

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:05.950
but it all worked out.

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:07.491
[PHOENIX]
You're wrong!

00:03:07.575 --> 00:03:10.616
Maya's trapped inside the
sacred cavern, but she's alive!

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.075
Still such an idiotic optimist.

00:03:13.158 --> 00:03:14.325
Oh, Feenie.

00:03:14.408 --> 00:03:15.616
[PHOENIX growls]

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.908
Let me share
a little something with you.

00:03:17.991 --> 00:03:20.908
When I met you that day,
it was hate at first sight.

00:03:20.991 --> 00:03:22.658
But after I got to know you,

00:03:22.741 --> 00:03:24.783
and saw the naive faith
you have in others,

00:03:24.866 --> 00:03:26.283
I grew to despise you.

00:03:26.366 --> 00:03:27.908
[PHOENIX]
Why would you kill Maya?

00:03:27.991 --> 00:03:29.200
[DAHLIA]
Hmph.

00:03:29.283 --> 00:03:31.783
Making her youngest
daughter the Master, well,

00:03:31.866 --> 00:03:34.158
it's practically all
my mother thinks about.

00:03:34.241 --> 00:03:35.658
But to do that,
she needed to eliminate

00:03:35.741 --> 00:03:38.616
the heir of the main
family. It's simple.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:40.533
To make Pearl the Master?

00:03:40.616 --> 00:03:42.866
What's all this "Master"
business, anyway?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.116
It's about who would
head the small, but influential,

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:47.450
Kurain School of Channeling.

00:03:47.533 --> 00:03:50.158
Both Morgan Fey and
Dahlia Hawthorne are members

00:03:50.241 --> 00:03:52.200
of the so-called
"branch" family,

00:03:52.283 --> 00:03:55.366
whereas Maya Fey is the
successor of the main family.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.241
[DAHLIA] If the main
bloodline were to die out,

00:03:57.325 --> 00:03:59.991
then the next master would
come from the branch family.

00:04:00.075 --> 00:04:01.783
That's actually the
only reason she even raised

00:04:01.866 --> 00:04:02.950
that little brat Pearl,

00:04:03.033 --> 00:04:05.033
who luckily has strong
spiritual powers!

00:04:05.116 --> 00:04:06.075
That's enough!

00:04:06.158 --> 00:04:07.741
Whether that's true or not,

00:04:07.825 --> 00:04:09.616
Pearl would never
go along with it!

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.075
Do you believe that
we cared if she agreed with us?

00:04:12.158 --> 00:04:14.241
She just had to do
what her mommy said.

00:04:14.325 --> 00:04:16.866
Be a good, obedient
little girl, and channel me.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.450
And after you took
over her body,

00:04:18.533 --> 00:04:20.200
you would be handling
all the rest.

00:04:20.283 --> 00:04:21.408
Is that right?

00:04:21.491 --> 00:04:22.950
Nail on the head.

00:04:23.033 --> 00:04:25.325
I mean, the whole plan was
an absolute train wreck,

00:04:25.408 --> 00:04:26.741
if you ask me.

00:04:26.825 --> 00:04:28.075
[PHOENIX]
If that's how you felt,

00:04:28.158 --> 00:04:30.283
why did you agree
to help her carry it out?

00:04:30.366 --> 00:04:31.658
[DAHLIA]
Why do you think?

00:04:31.741 --> 00:04:34.033
Because I thought it
would serve my interests.

00:04:34.116 --> 00:04:36.283
I had my own agenda
to consider, you know.

00:04:36.366 --> 00:04:37.783
[PHOENIX]
And what might that be?

00:04:37.866 --> 00:04:40.325
Mine? Pure revenge.

00:04:40.408 --> 00:04:42.325
Powerful force, huh?

00:04:42.408 --> 00:04:45.408
[DAHLIA] Every day, the thought
burned inside my brain.

00:04:45.491 --> 00:04:49.033
That I was sent to die
because of that damned woman.

00:04:52.116 --> 00:04:54.658
[gasps]
Mia.

00:04:54.741 --> 00:04:56.866
I wanted her to face
the same humiliation

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.325
that she put me through.

00:04:58.408 --> 00:05:00.283
I wanted to make her feel
the kind of pain that I felt

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.491
every single day of my life.

00:05:02.575 --> 00:05:04.116
That's pretty nutty.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.116
I was absolutely livid
when I found out

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.741
she died before me.

00:05:07.825 --> 00:05:11.491
But still... A person's soul
will live on into eternity.

00:05:11.575 --> 00:05:13.575
So to harm her soul,
I would take the life of

00:05:13.658 --> 00:05:16.200
the one she loved most
with my own hands!

00:05:16.283 --> 00:05:19.366
And then... I would
finally have my revenge!

00:05:19.450 --> 00:05:20.575
[PHOENIX]
Are you serious?

00:05:20.658 --> 00:05:22.533
You'd kill an innocent
person for that?!

00:05:22.616 --> 00:05:23.908
[DAHLIA]
I'm dead, remember?

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:25.575
So don't waste your breath
trying to make me

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:27.158
feel guilty about it.

00:05:27.241 --> 00:05:28.616
There's nothing you
can do that's worse than

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.033
what I've already been through.

00:05:30.116 --> 00:05:31.491
[PHOENIX growls]

00:05:31.575 --> 00:05:32.908
On that night,

00:05:32.991 --> 00:05:36.825
around 9:30, I crossed
the void back into this world.

00:05:36.908 --> 00:05:39.491
I quickly pinned up
my hair and put on a hood.

00:05:39.575 --> 00:05:41.158
Then I grabbed the
staff sitting next to me

00:05:41.241 --> 00:05:42.908
and left Hazakura Temple.

00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:47.075
That clown of a head nun
at the Inner Temple

00:05:47.158 --> 00:05:49.533
never imagined
that I wasn't Iris.

00:05:49.616 --> 00:05:51.658
She went back to the main
temple, which meant I would be

00:05:51.741 --> 00:05:54.741
alone with Maya, who was
still getting ready to train.

00:05:56.825 --> 00:05:58.325
[DAHLIA] I was able
to corner her in front of

00:05:58.408 --> 00:06:00.158
the stone lantern,
took out the dagger

00:06:00.241 --> 00:06:01.700
I found in the storeroom,

00:06:01.783 --> 00:06:04.241
and went after her with
a huge smile on my face.

00:06:04.325 --> 00:06:05.866
[slashing, blood splashing]

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:09.491
Say what? Do you mean
you stabbed Maya?

00:06:09.575 --> 00:06:12.325
It's weird, things got foggy.

00:06:12.408 --> 00:06:14.450
I don't remember
what happened next.

00:06:14.533 --> 00:06:18.491
But I think maybe... I
somehow got stabbed instead.

00:06:18.575 --> 00:06:20.575
By who? Who would stab you?

00:06:20.658 --> 00:06:22.158
It was Maya, you dolt!

00:06:22.241 --> 00:06:26.158
Who else could have done it?
She killed me!

00:06:26.241 --> 00:06:28.283
No way! You're lying.

00:06:28.366 --> 00:06:29.700
She would never!

00:06:29.783 --> 00:06:31.741
[DAHLIA]
I started to black out.

00:06:31.825 --> 00:06:34.866
So I scrawled her name
on the lantern in blood,

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.991
hoping that would draw suspicion
to her, at the very least.

00:06:40.075 --> 00:06:42.241
Tch. Still so vindictive.

00:06:42.325 --> 00:06:44.658
[DAHLIA] I don't know
how long I was unconscious.

00:06:44.741 --> 00:06:46.241
But when I woke up.

00:06:46.325 --> 00:06:50.116
I realized I was inside
the Sacred Cavern.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:53.075
[JUDGE] Is that so?
How did you end up there?

00:06:53.158 --> 00:06:54.658
[DAHLIA]
No clue, grandpa.

00:06:54.741 --> 00:06:57.158
But I did know that I wanted
the satisfaction of seeing

00:06:57.241 --> 00:06:58.991
Maya's dead body on the ground.

00:06:59.075 --> 00:07:00.450
However...

00:07:00.533 --> 00:07:01.700
...I couldn't get out.

00:07:05.533 --> 00:07:07.825
[PHOENIX] Right, because
of the trick lock!

00:07:07.908 --> 00:07:10.908
[DAHLIA] I took me hours
to get that damn thing open!

00:07:10.991 --> 00:07:12.991
And almost the exact
moment I stepped out.

00:07:13.075 --> 00:07:14.241
The earthquake hit.

00:07:16.325 --> 00:07:17.825
[DAHLIA]
But I was in luck.

00:07:17.908 --> 00:07:19.033
Because there she was.

00:07:19.116 --> 00:07:20.408
[IRIS pants]

00:07:20.491 --> 00:07:22.325
[DAHLIA] Iris showed up,
and to make it even sweeter,

00:07:22.408 --> 00:07:24.741
she was all by herself.

00:07:24.825 --> 00:07:27.283
I got her to tell me
everything that was going on.

00:07:28.866 --> 00:07:31.658
[DAHLIA] And then, I locked
her up in the sacred cavern.

00:07:31.741 --> 00:07:33.408
Shortly after...

00:07:33.491 --> 00:07:35.491
...I put the pieces together.

00:07:35.575 --> 00:07:37.200
What do you mean by that?

00:07:37.283 --> 00:07:40.033
[DAHLIA] I'd misunderstood
one important thing.

00:07:40.116 --> 00:07:42.491
I was under the impression
that Pearl Fey had been the one

00:07:42.575 --> 00:07:44.408
who summoned me
the night before.

00:07:44.491 --> 00:07:46.408
Well, that was part
of the plan your mother

00:07:46.491 --> 00:07:47.825
had brewed up, wasn't it?

00:07:47.908 --> 00:07:49.408
But that's not how it went.

00:07:49.491 --> 00:07:51.783
The person who had actually
called my spirit over

00:07:51.866 --> 00:07:53.325
from the other side was...

00:07:53.408 --> 00:07:55.450
It was Elise Deauxnim, right?

00:07:55.533 --> 00:07:57.075
Misty Fey herself.

00:07:57.158 --> 00:08:00.491
Yeah! So then
I realized something.

00:08:00.575 --> 00:08:02.991
After I lost consciousness,
it was her body left lying

00:08:03.075 --> 00:08:04.908
in front of the lantern.

00:08:04.991 --> 00:08:07.283
Even though
I wasn't able to kill Maya.

00:08:07.366 --> 00:08:09.658
I did successfully force her
into committing one of

00:08:09.741 --> 00:08:12.116
the most disgusting
and vile sins a person

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:13.491
could ever dream of!

00:08:15.325 --> 00:08:18.575
[DAHLIA] Yes! I made her
kill her very own mother!

00:08:20.866 --> 00:08:23.866
[DAHLIA] And unable to bear the
guilt for such a horrific act.

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.575
Maya Fey took
her own pitiful life.

00:08:26.658 --> 00:08:27.991
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:08:28.075 --> 00:08:30.408
Maya! She would never do that!

00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:32.075
[DAHLIA] Well, if you
don't believe me,

00:08:32.158 --> 00:08:35.533
why don't you tell me exactly
where she is right now.

00:08:35.616 --> 00:08:37.325
[PHOENIX] Why don't you
tell us where she is?

00:08:37.408 --> 00:08:38.908
The cave, right?

00:08:38.991 --> 00:08:40.408
The bottom of Eagle River.

00:08:40.491 --> 00:08:41.783
[gasps]

00:08:41.866 --> 00:08:43.116
[DAHLIA] After killing
her poor mother to thwart

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:45.741
that unexpected attack,
she threw herself

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:48.325
into the river
in a fit of despair.

00:08:48.408 --> 00:08:52.200
And most bodies that wind up
there, never come back out.

00:08:52.283 --> 00:08:55.741
No! She's just been trapped in
the sacred cavern all this time!

00:08:55.825 --> 00:08:59.491
Sorry. Somebody's
giving me a buzz.

00:08:59.575 --> 00:09:02.325
Prosecutor Godot, not right now.

00:09:02.408 --> 00:09:05.116
[GODOT]
All right, great, thanks.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:06.616
Excuse me.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.408
But I wanted to be alerted when
they got the locks removed

00:09:08.491 --> 00:09:10.116
from the sacred cavern.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:12.783
They're off?!
Has anybody found Maya?

00:09:12.866 --> 00:09:15.825
Apparently, there was
a woman found inside the cave.

00:09:15.908 --> 00:09:19.241
And that was Sister Iris.
She was alone.

00:09:19.325 --> 00:09:20.950
They say anything about Maya?

00:09:21.033 --> 00:09:22.783
[GODOT]
According to that call,

00:09:22.866 --> 00:09:25.075
Iris was the only
one they found.

00:09:25.158 --> 00:09:26.241
Oh, no...

00:09:26.325 --> 00:09:27.991
I wasn't lying, you fool.

00:09:28.075 --> 00:09:30.491
You should try dragging
the river instead.

00:09:30.575 --> 00:09:31.991
Her body might turn up.

00:09:32.075 --> 00:09:35.908
[PHOENIX growls, yells]

00:09:35.991 --> 00:09:38.491
[cackles]

00:09:38.575 --> 00:09:40.075
The plan actually worked!

00:09:40.158 --> 00:09:41.700
Vengeance is mine!

00:09:41.783 --> 00:09:44.533
So, like I said,
check the river.

00:09:44.616 --> 00:09:46.658
Face it! There's
nowhere else around there

00:09:46.741 --> 00:09:49.283
that little idiot Maya Fey
could be hiding!

00:09:49.366 --> 00:09:50.491
She's dead!

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.950
[GODOT]
Hmph.

00:09:54.033 --> 00:09:55.158
So Trite...

00:09:55.241 --> 00:09:57.283
There's a saying you
might've heard before.

00:09:57.366 --> 00:10:00.700
It goes, "Once you
eliminate the impossible,

00:10:00.783 --> 00:10:02.825
whatever remains,
no matter how improbable,

00:10:02.908 --> 00:10:04.783
must be the truth."

00:10:04.866 --> 00:10:08.241
"Whatever remains is the truth."

00:10:08.325 --> 00:10:09.741
Nobody has seen
or heard from Maya

00:10:09.825 --> 00:10:11.491
since that night.

00:10:11.575 --> 00:10:15.533
She's not in the main temple,
the cave, or the inner temple.

00:10:15.616 --> 00:10:18.366
And I don't believe she'd
throw herself into the river.

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:20.866
So what's left?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:23.533
Of course! It's improbable...

00:10:23.616 --> 00:10:25.325
...but not impossible.

00:10:28.116 --> 00:10:32.533
[PHOENIX] Dahlia. I have
an idea where we can find her.

00:10:32.616 --> 00:10:35.283
One last place where
she could possibly be hiding.

00:10:35.366 --> 00:10:39.241
You're terrible at bluffing.
But go on, tell us where she is.

00:10:39.325 --> 00:10:42.366
Okay. But let me
ask you something first.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.658
Who's channeling you right now?

00:10:44.741 --> 00:10:46.450
[DAHLIA]
What a stupid question.

00:10:46.533 --> 00:10:50.158
It's that pathetic, sniveling
little rug-rat, Pearl Fey.

00:10:51.658 --> 00:10:53.200
But it can't be her.

00:10:53.283 --> 00:10:55.366
'Cause she's here with us,
watching from

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.741
the courtroom gallery.

00:10:56.825 --> 00:10:59.241
[DAHLIA]
Huh? Then who?

00:10:59.325 --> 00:11:00.950
[PHOENIX]
There's one possibility.

00:11:01.033 --> 00:11:02.866
And you're not gonna like it.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:05.366
The person channeling
you is Maya Fey!

00:11:05.450 --> 00:11:08.283
What?! That can't be!

00:11:08.366 --> 00:11:10.825
[PHOENIX] After she
realized what was going on,

00:11:10.908 --> 00:11:14.116
Maya then made the conscious
decision to channel you.

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.075
It was the only way
to defend herself.

00:11:17.158 --> 00:11:18.825
N-No way...

00:11:18.908 --> 00:11:21.741
Yes. The very last place
Maya could hide

00:11:21.825 --> 00:11:25.575
is right here in plain sight.
She's hidden inside you!

00:11:26.533 --> 00:11:29.033
[screams]

00:11:29.116 --> 00:11:30.741
[CROWD gasping, murmuring]

00:11:30.825 --> 00:11:33.366
[JUDGE]
Order! I will have order!

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.241
No. I don't believe
a single word you're saying.

00:11:36.325 --> 00:11:38.200
That soft-headed little girl
could never come up with

00:11:38.283 --> 00:11:40.116
such a smart plan!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:42.116
She doesn't have
the brains for it!

00:11:42.200 --> 00:11:43.658
So then why don't you
tell me who gave her

00:11:43.741 --> 00:11:46.366
such a brilliant idea, huh?

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.575
It was...

00:11:47.658 --> 00:11:49.908
[courtroom doors creak]

00:11:49.991 --> 00:11:51.200
--[gasps]
--[MIA] It was me.

00:11:51.283 --> 00:11:52.533
[GODOT gasps]

00:11:55.116 --> 00:11:56.783
[gasps]

00:11:58.408 --> 00:12:00.491
Of course. Who'd you think?

00:12:01.783 --> 00:12:03.491
Mia!

00:12:03.575 --> 00:12:04.741
[MIA]
Hmph.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.408
How dare you show your face.

00:12:11.491 --> 00:12:14.158
It's been awhile.
Seems like you missed me.

00:12:14.241 --> 00:12:16.366
[GODOT]
So. It was you all along, huh?

00:12:18.408 --> 00:12:19.533
It was.

00:12:19.616 --> 00:12:22.491
Heh. You really
are something else.

00:12:22.575 --> 00:12:24.658
But why? Why are you here?

00:12:24.741 --> 00:12:26.158
That night,

00:12:26.241 --> 00:12:28.741
you backed Maya into a corner
outside the inner temple.

00:12:28.825 --> 00:12:30.533
But right before
you could kill her,

00:12:30.616 --> 00:12:31.950
you blacked out, didn't you?

00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:34.700
Yeah! That's because
I was stabbed!

00:12:34.783 --> 00:12:36.033
Maya stabbed me!

00:12:37.491 --> 00:12:40.700
[MIA] But she lost consciousness
at the exact same time.

00:12:40.783 --> 00:12:42.658
[PHOENIX] Which means, it had
to have been somebody else

00:12:42.741 --> 00:12:45.491
there who stabbed you.

00:12:45.575 --> 00:12:47.825
[MIA] A short time later,
when Maya woke up,

00:12:47.908 --> 00:12:49.825
she was in the training hall.

00:12:49.908 --> 00:12:52.575
She immediately wrote a note
about what was going on

00:12:52.658 --> 00:12:54.783
and proceeded to channel me.

00:12:54.866 --> 00:12:58.408
She asked for my advice,
what I thought she should do.

00:12:58.491 --> 00:13:00.325
I didn't think she was
smart enough for that.

00:13:00.408 --> 00:13:02.616
I didn't have all
the details at the time,

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.741
but one thing was
perfectly clear to me.

00:13:04.825 --> 00:13:06.033
Which was?

00:13:06.116 --> 00:13:07.783
The simple fact that
you could not be allowed

00:13:07.866 --> 00:13:09.491
to wander around freely.

00:13:09.575 --> 00:13:12.366
I wrote down two things
that she absolutely had to do.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.200
The first step was to
channel Dahlia Hawthorne.

00:13:15.283 --> 00:13:16.866
And the second was to hide.

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.950
Lock herself in the
cavern until help arrived.

00:13:19.033 --> 00:13:20.200
I see.

00:13:20.283 --> 00:13:22.325
So it was Maya who put
that lock on the door.

00:13:22.408 --> 00:13:23.991
I never would've
considered that.

00:13:24.075 --> 00:13:26.283
She had to do it quickly,
or Dahlia definitely would've

00:13:26.366 --> 00:13:29.700
been channeled by Pearl instead.
And if that had happened...

00:13:29.783 --> 00:13:31.825
...this demonic spirit here
would have used the body

00:13:31.908 --> 00:13:36.991
of that little girl to take her
murderous revenge out on Maya.

00:13:37.075 --> 00:13:39.950
There's no way...
How could I have been...

00:13:40.033 --> 00:13:41.700
Could have been such a failure?

00:13:41.783 --> 00:13:44.116
Because that's all your plan
amounted to in the end.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.408
Another loss.

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:47.241
Typical. Right?

00:13:47.325 --> 00:13:48.950
[DAHLIA]
What do you mean?

00:13:49.033 --> 00:13:50.616
[PHOENIX]
Your track record stinks.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.700
I mean, have you ever been
successful in pulling off

00:13:52.783 --> 00:13:54.200
one of your little schemes?

00:13:54.283 --> 00:13:55.491
[DAHLIA growls]

00:13:55.575 --> 00:13:58.116
[PHOENIX] The fake
kidnapping ten years ago...

00:13:58.200 --> 00:14:00.491
...the time you
tried to kill me...

00:14:00.575 --> 00:14:02.825
...when you wound up killing
somebody else and all you got

00:14:02.908 --> 00:14:04.783
from it was a death sentence.

00:14:04.866 --> 00:14:06.991
Just one stupid
move after another.

00:14:07.075 --> 00:14:08.450
It's so bad,
it's not even funny.

00:14:08.533 --> 00:14:09.450
[DAHLIA]
Shut up!

00:14:09.533 --> 00:14:11.033
And now this.

00:14:11.116 --> 00:14:14.450
You stepped in it once again,
because you couldn't fool Mia.

00:14:14.533 --> 00:14:15.866
Maya was right
there in front of you,

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:19.033
and she still got away,
because of your incompetence.

00:14:19.116 --> 00:14:22.283
[DAHLIA snarls]
Damn you, Mia Fey!

00:14:22.366 --> 00:14:24.200
I despise you.

00:14:24.283 --> 00:14:26.616
Why did you have to get
in my way again?!

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:29.366
[MIA] Oh, please,
it's not all my fault.

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.575
The fact is,
you will never beat me.

00:14:31.658 --> 00:14:32.991
What'd you say...?

00:14:33.075 --> 00:14:36.950
Never in your life, and,
apparently, not even in death.

00:14:37.033 --> 00:14:39.200
Seems like you're going
to be a complete embarrassment

00:14:39.283 --> 00:14:41.575
for the rest of time!

00:14:41.658 --> 00:14:42.908
Remember this?

00:14:42.991 --> 00:14:44.950
You said the dead
couldn't be punished.

00:14:45.033 --> 00:14:47.450
But you also said that
a person's soul lives on

00:14:47.533 --> 00:14:49.783
for all of eternity.

00:14:49.866 --> 00:14:52.616
[MIA] And that's the punishment
from which you'll never escape.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.783
You're always going to be
that weak, insecure,

00:14:54.866 --> 00:14:57.283
pathetic creature known
as Dahlia Hawthorne.

00:14:57.366 --> 00:14:59.450
A petty, perpetual loser!

00:14:59.533 --> 00:15:01.450
To be honest,
that sounds like one hell

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:03.033
of a punishment to me.

00:15:03.116 --> 00:15:05.116
And on the very day
you were executed,

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:08.116
your narrow little bridge to
freedom burned under your feet!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.116
No...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.283
You're wrong!

00:15:10.366 --> 00:15:11.866
It can't be...

00:15:11.950 --> 00:15:13.950
[demonic] How the
hell could I lose to you?!

00:15:14.033 --> 00:15:16.200
I'm the superior one!

00:15:16.283 --> 00:15:18.866
Think whatever you want,
but it won't make a difference.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:19.991
Dahlia!

00:15:21.991 --> 00:15:24.950
I order you to get out
of Maya Fey's body right now!

00:15:25.033 --> 00:15:28.408
[roars]

00:15:28.491 --> 00:15:32.491
[demonic]
Not yet! No! I'm not ready!

00:15:32.575 --> 00:15:37.158
[shrieks]

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:56.116
Hey, Nick,
is that really you...?

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.491
And Mia...?

00:15:57.575 --> 00:15:59.700
[sighs]

00:15:59.783 --> 00:16:02.741
Yeah, it's me. Glad you're back.

00:16:02.825 --> 00:16:04.991
[JUDGE]
Now, then. Is it safe to assume

00:16:05.075 --> 00:16:08.075
I'm speaking with the
real Sister Iris this time?

00:16:08.158 --> 00:16:09.241
Yes.

00:16:09.325 --> 00:16:10.575
[JUDGE] I'm sure you've
heard this before,

00:16:10.658 --> 00:16:12.616
but you two look awfully alike.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.991
Well, anyway!

00:16:14.075 --> 00:16:16.325
I shall hereby deliver
the verdict in this case!

00:16:16.408 --> 00:16:18.533
[GODOT]
Objection!

00:16:18.616 --> 00:16:22.408
Slow down with the gavel, chief.
Did ya have too much caffeine?

00:16:22.491 --> 00:16:24.533
[JUDGE]
Uh, what are you talking about?

00:16:24.616 --> 00:16:26.241
He means the trial isn't over.

00:16:26.325 --> 00:16:27.325
[gasps]

00:16:27.408 --> 00:16:29.575
You can't just
exorcise an evil spirit,

00:16:29.658 --> 00:16:31.241
give yourself
a pat on the back,

00:16:31.325 --> 00:16:33.616
then expect to go
on your merry way.

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:35.116
The bitter truth is Misty Fey,

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:38.575
Master of the Kurain School,
was actually murdered.

00:16:38.658 --> 00:16:40.158
She's dead,
and we still don't know

00:16:40.241 --> 00:16:42.408
who's to blame, do we now?

00:16:42.491 --> 00:16:44.783
[JUDGE] But I'm afraid
the court isn't prepared for

00:16:44.866 --> 00:16:48.241
any further
deliberations at this time.

00:16:48.325 --> 00:16:51.075
The prosecution
will issue our final summons.

00:16:51.158 --> 00:16:53.200
And this one is going to
clear up the whole mystery.

00:16:53.283 --> 00:16:56.450
They'll answer the question
of who murdered Misty Fey!

00:16:58.283 --> 00:17:00.783
[MIA] You sure about this,
Mister Prosecutor?

00:17:00.866 --> 00:17:03.616
[GODOT] Hmph. But of course,
Madame Attorney.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:05.075
I'm positive.

00:17:05.158 --> 00:17:07.866
[PHOENIX gasps]

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.866
Mia...?

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:12.991
Okay. Who might
this final witness be?

00:17:13.075 --> 00:17:15.450
[GODOT]
Heh. I thought it was obvious.

00:17:15.533 --> 00:17:17.825
The only person we know
was there that night.

00:17:17.908 --> 00:17:19.741
Who saw her mother die.

00:17:19.825 --> 00:17:21.325
Wait, do you mean, Maya?

00:17:21.408 --> 00:17:23.491
You can't put her on the stand
after what she's been though!

00:17:23.575 --> 00:17:25.033
We need to find the truth!

00:17:25.116 --> 00:17:26.241
[gasps]

00:17:26.325 --> 00:17:28.533
[JUDGE]
Hmm. Very well, then.

00:17:28.616 --> 00:17:31.116
The court will now adjourn
for a short recess.

00:17:31.200 --> 00:17:32.991
Once the witness
is ready to testify,

00:17:33.075 --> 00:17:34.741
we will proceed with the trial!

00:17:34.825 --> 00:17:35.908
[GODOT]
Listen, Trite.

00:17:35.991 --> 00:17:37.575
I'm just gonna get
this out there, okay?

00:17:37.658 --> 00:17:38.908
What?

00:17:38.991 --> 00:17:41.241
Put mildly, I don't
have a high opinion of you.

00:17:41.325 --> 00:17:42.866
Your methods are sloppy,

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:44.866
you squeak by without even
the faintest understanding

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.283
of the case,

00:17:46.366 --> 00:17:48.325
and then some beautiful woman
always comes dashing in

00:17:48.408 --> 00:17:50.825
at the last minute to save you.

00:17:50.908 --> 00:17:53.783
You haven't earned the right
to call yourself an attorney!

00:17:53.866 --> 00:17:55.408
This time around,
you're gonna have to

00:17:55.491 --> 00:17:57.450
do this all by yourself.

00:17:57.533 --> 00:17:59.283
[PHOENIX sighs]

00:17:59.366 --> 00:18:01.658
[IRIS] Please forgive me
for worrying you.

00:18:01.741 --> 00:18:05.283
I'm glad you're okay.
Look, we're short on time.

00:18:05.366 --> 00:18:06.866
Tell me what
happened that night.

00:18:08.450 --> 00:18:10.866
Well, after I rang
the bell for lights out,

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:12.116
I got a phone call.

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:14.033
It would have been around 10:30.

00:18:14.116 --> 00:18:17.200
I was asked to come to
the Inner Temple at once, so...

00:18:17.283 --> 00:18:18.533
A call?

00:18:18.616 --> 00:18:21.158
That's right. I got on
the snowmobile right away.

00:18:21.241 --> 00:18:23.825
But then... I couldn't
reach the inner temple.

00:18:23.908 --> 00:18:25.450
Because of what
happened to the bridge.

00:18:25.533 --> 00:18:26.700
The lightning.

00:18:26.783 --> 00:18:29.658
Yes. I had been told
to receive Elise's body

00:18:29.741 --> 00:18:32.116
on top of the gorge
and take it to the temple.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.075
So that's exactly what I did.

00:18:34.158 --> 00:18:35.533
[PHOENIX] And when you
were staging the body

00:18:35.616 --> 00:18:39.741
in the courtyard, that's when
Sister Bikini saw you?

00:18:39.825 --> 00:18:41.200
[IRIS grunts]

00:18:41.283 --> 00:18:43.241
Iris! I need the truth!

00:18:43.325 --> 00:18:45.658
You gotta tell me who it was
that called you and told you

00:18:45.741 --> 00:18:46.908
to move the body!

00:18:46.991 --> 00:18:49.741
They have to be the one
who murdered Misty Fey!

00:18:49.825 --> 00:18:52.325
[IRIS whimpers]

00:18:52.408 --> 00:18:53.908
Please forgive me!

00:18:53.991 --> 00:18:57.200
But I just can't do it. I can't
tell you who was behind this!

00:18:57.283 --> 00:18:58.616
[sighs]

00:19:00.158 --> 00:19:02.908
[BAILIFF 213A] Defendant,
the judge is calling for you.

00:19:02.991 --> 00:19:04.658
Listen. Mister Wright,

00:19:04.741 --> 00:19:06.741
--I, uh...
--[grunts]

00:19:06.825 --> 00:19:07.991
[BAILIFF 213A]
Hurry up, defendant.

00:19:18.866 --> 00:19:20.033
Phoenix.

00:19:20.116 --> 00:19:22.908
[PHOENIX]
Mia! Uh... How's Maya?

00:19:22.991 --> 00:19:24.908
Is she feeling okay?

00:19:24.991 --> 00:19:26.741
[MIA]
Physically, she'll be fine.

00:19:26.825 --> 00:19:30.533
However... Emotionally speaking,
she's been very badly hurt.

00:19:30.616 --> 00:19:31.783
I understand.

00:19:31.866 --> 00:19:34.491
Did anyone tell her
Elise was your mother?

00:19:34.575 --> 00:19:37.408
I did. I talked to her just now.

00:19:37.491 --> 00:19:40.116
And told her everything
I knew about what happened.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.325
Poor Maya...

00:19:42.408 --> 00:19:44.658
She's always been
extremely strong.

00:19:44.741 --> 00:19:47.866
I've no doubt she can
handle it. All of it.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:50.616
All of it?
What do you mean by that?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.158
You're going to need
to figure that answer out

00:19:52.241 --> 00:19:55.991
by yourself. This will
truly be the final battle.

00:19:57.783 --> 00:19:59.116
Who's behind it?

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.616
I need to go back and re-examine
the sequence of events.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.491
We know she was
really killed in the garden

00:20:04.575 --> 00:20:06.408
of the Inner Temple.

00:20:06.491 --> 00:20:09.741
I find it hard to believe the
killer was there by accident.

00:20:09.825 --> 00:20:11.658
Which means they must've
known of the plan

00:20:11.741 --> 00:20:13.825
from the very beginning.

00:20:13.908 --> 00:20:15.991
What's more,
the victim was moved across

00:20:16.075 --> 00:20:18.991
the burning bridge by
means of a pendulum.

00:20:19.075 --> 00:20:20.741
In other words,
the killer wasn't able

00:20:20.825 --> 00:20:22.866
to cross the bridge.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:25.491
So that would mean,
it would have been someone

00:20:25.575 --> 00:20:28.200
who wasn't on the main
temple side the next day.

00:20:28.283 --> 00:20:30.116
[MIA]
Hmm.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:31.950
The trial's about to resume.

00:20:32.033 --> 00:20:34.116
We need the defense to
return to the courtroom.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:35.200
Right.

00:20:35.283 --> 00:20:37.241
I've done as much
as I can, Phoenix.

00:20:37.325 --> 00:20:38.450
My time is up.

00:20:38.533 --> 00:20:39.950
Thank you, Mia.

00:20:40.033 --> 00:20:41.908
The rest of the battle
in your hands now,

00:20:41.991 --> 00:20:43.866
but I have faith in you.

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.866
I've got it.
I appreciate all you've done.

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:56.241
[PHOENIX] It's time to finally
bring this case to an end.

00:20:56.325 --> 00:20:58.033
What did Maya see that night?

00:20:58.116 --> 00:21:00.825
And who was it that actually
killed Misty Fey?

00:21:03.408 --> 00:21:04.741
[PHOENIX]
Whatever my conclusion,

00:21:04.825 --> 00:21:06.408
I'll have to prove it.

00:21:06.491 --> 00:21:08.783
And I'll have only
myself to rely on.

00:21:08.866 --> 00:21:10.491
[JUDGE] Before we
resume the proceedings,

00:21:10.575 --> 00:21:12.575
I have an important
announcement to make.

00:21:12.658 --> 00:21:13.908
[PHOENIX]
What's that?

00:21:13.991 --> 00:21:16.325
Two weapons were
presented as evidence.

00:21:16.408 --> 00:21:19.200
The bloodstains on both
have now been analyzed.

00:21:19.283 --> 00:21:21.075
And the results
indicate the murder weapon

00:21:21.158 --> 00:21:23.783
was the sword hidden
inside the staff.

00:21:23.866 --> 00:21:27.033
[PHOENIX] But, what about
the bloodstain on the dagger?

00:21:27.116 --> 00:21:28.450
I'm not sure.

00:21:28.533 --> 00:21:31.116
But at the very least
it was not the victim's.

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:32.908
[PHOENIX grunts]

00:21:32.991 --> 00:21:35.325
Now. Bring in the final witness!

00:21:42.533 --> 00:21:43.783
Maya...

00:21:46.741 --> 00:21:47.825
[gasps]

00:21:49.533 --> 00:21:51.075
Help me, Nick...

00:23:22.450 --> 00:23:23.825
[PHOENIX]
Objection!

00:23:23.908 --> 00:23:26.116
This case has reached
the final stage.

00:23:26.200 --> 00:23:28.200
We have to learn what
really happened that night.

00:23:28.283 --> 00:23:30.033
Who killed Maya's mother?

00:23:30.116 --> 00:23:32.075
As the moment o,
truth draws closer.

00:23:32.158 --> 00:23:33.366
Maya takes the witness stand,

00:23:33.450 --> 00:23:36.575
and the harsh, painful
reality comes to light.

00:23:36.658 --> 00:23:39.116
The end of this long trial
will be filled with tears

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:41.450
cried over sins of the past.

00:23:41.533 --> 00:23:44.033
Find the contradictions!
Believe in the truth!

00:23:44.116 --> 00:23:45.825
Next time,
the final episode:

00:23:45.908 --> 00:23:48.241
"Bridge to the
Turnabout -- Last Trial!"

00:23:48.325 --> 00:23:49.533
Take that!
